flowchart LR
    A[Raw Text] --> B[Tokenizer]
    B --> C[Token IDs]

    C --> D[Padding / Truncation]
    D --> E[Padded Token IDs]
    D --> F[Attention Mask]

    E --> G[Embedding Lookup]
    G --> H[Token Embeddings]

    H --> I[Add Positional Information]
    I --> J[Final Model Input]

    F --> J
    J --> K[Ready for Model Processing]
